{"id":"prepositions-0041","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 41","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Advertising has a huge influence ___ children.","hint":"influence ___ sb","explanation":"have an influence ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"from","accept":["against"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Sunscreen protects the skin ___ UV rays.","hint":"protect ___ sth harmful","explanation":"protect somebody/something FROM (or AGAINST) harm."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The song reminds me ___ my first holiday abroad.","hint":"remind sb ___ sth","explanation":"remind somebody OF something = make them remember; remind somebody ABOUT = tell them not to forget."},{"answer":"into","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Further research ___ the disease is needed.","hint":"research ___ sth","explanation":"research INTO a subject (less commonly \u0027on\u0027)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He spends far too much ___ computer games.","hint":"spend money/time ___ sth","explanation":"spend money/time ON something."},{"answer":"on","accept":["upon"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We rely ___ public transport to get to work.","hint":"rely ___ sb/sth","explanation":"rely ON (upon) somebody/something."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was found guilty ___ fraud.","hint":"guilty ___ sth","explanation":"guilty OF a crime."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Millions suffer ___ hay fever every summer.","hint":"suffer ___ sth","explanation":"suffer FROM an illness/problem."}]}